{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50711","headline":"送刘轺秀才江陵归宁 · 张祜","name":"送刘轺秀才江陵归宁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出告游方是素辞，喜君回棹不逾时。\n荆门暮指连山远，郢国春归上水迟。\n罇酒惜离文举坐，郡斋谁覆中宣碁。\n（《舆地纪胜》卷六五引以上四句，「中宣」作「仲宣」，是。\n）殷勤莫忘趋庭日，学礼三余已学诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}